{
    "title": "EXPO NM & NM State Fair",
    "description": "The Official New Mexico State Fair mobile app is your one-stop guide to all the State Fair fun! Purchase admission tickets, find favorite food vendors, and plan your day at the Fair right from the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\nWith features that give fair goers all the fun at their fingertips, the New Mexico State Fair app will become your trusted partner when planning your trip to the Fair. Navigate the Fair easily; find parking lots, rides, food, stages, venues, exhibit halls, restrooms, and more. Stay up to date with notifications about important Fair updates, concert announcements and more!\r\n\r\nBuy admission, rodeo, and concert tickets \u2013 anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nPlan Your Trip \u2013 check out the complete State Fair Daily Schedule.\r\n\r\nInteractive Map \u2013 Navigate the Fair easily; find parking lots, rides, food, stages, venues, exhibit halls, restrooms, lost and found, and more!",
